WEBVTT

00:29:27.328 --> 00:29:31.140
among the leadership team here about,
you know, how on earth should we do this?

00:29:31.164 --> 00:29:34.959
And I mean, most of the teams
are still organized on sort of --

00:29:34.983 --> 00:29:36.595
like there's an open team area.

00:29:36.619 --> 00:29:39.420
People don't have individual offices.

00:29:39.444 --> 00:29:42.352
We realized, you know,
we had to take you seriously,

00:29:42.376 --> 00:29:46.953
and we put in lots of little nooks
where you can sort of,

00:29:46.977 --> 00:29:50.150
you know, hide away in a chair
with a view of the outside

00:29:50.174 --> 00:29:53.685
and hopefully, hopefully, hopefully,
cater for those moments

00:29:53.709 --> 00:29:56.683
when someone either needs
to get away for a bit

00:29:56.707 --> 00:30:00.764
or just do quiet, concentrated work.